NODE id=matrix/router/internal/admin.Handler.StartProvision kind=method
  digest=b3:4de9dc1e2122511d9691638f82ddc5a09c05d8444fee97dd23e5c0d1df760ad3 file=router/internal/admin/admin.go range=210:241 lang=go exported=true byte_range=7451:8770
  sig=func (h *Handler) StartProvision(userID, email string)
  doc=StartProvision triggers EnsureMachine for userID out-of-band and\nreturns immediately, so the proxy can auto-provision on a first\nauthenticated request without blocking the response. Concurrent calls\nfor the same user are deduplicated via inflight, so a burst of first\nrequests provisions exactly one environment.
