NODE id=matrix/router/internal/admin.generateInviteCode kind=func
  digest=b3:20395012acc7b09986b31d0e93d998bdfcf6c619b368acb553814b812ebd0cb2 file=router/internal/admin/beta.go range=228:238 lang=go exported=false byte_range=6753:7165
  sig=func generateInviteCode() (string, error)
  doc=generateInviteCode produces a 24-character hex string (12 bytes of\ncrypto-strong entropy). 2^96 possibilities — unguessable. Returns an\nerror if the system CSPRNG fails, so a degraded-entropy (e.g. all-zero)\ncode can never be issued.
EDGES
  ^defines=matrix/router/internal/admin/beta.go

